     A*
     A* Provima Bill Transmission Information
     A*
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Created on 07/21/05 by c:79 for Project 129MJR from FAU9P
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Purpose: This file will hold the member #, date/time uploaded,
     A*          date/time converted, and date/time processed of the
     A*          "batch" of bills received from Provima.
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Revisions:
     A*
     A* 09/30/03 c:62 Project 126MBR
     A*               Add count fields
     A*
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(FSREFP)
     A          R PW901                     TEXT('Provima Bill Trans Info')
     A            W9NAME    R               REFFLD(DS10)
     A                                      COLHDG('FPRVP member #')
     A            W9MBR#    R               REFFLD(DS10)
     A                                      COLHDG('FAW0P member #')
     A            W9ULDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Upload Date')
     A*           Upload date when FAW9P record created, FAW9P Member
     A*           name assigned
     A*
     A            W9ULTM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Upload Time')
     A            W9CVDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Convert Date')
     A*           Convert date when data converted from FAW0P file to
     A*           FAW1P and FAW2P
     A*
     A            W9CVTM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Convert Time')
     A            W9PRDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Process Date')
     A*           Process date when all FAW1P records have a value
     A*           in W1PRFL for a given "batch".  This will prevent
     A*           the document in Provima from appearing on the "Upload
     A*           Provima Bills" screen, since all the FAW1P records
     A*           have been processed.  We don't want to process that
     A*           member again.
     A*
     A            W9PRTM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Process Time')
     A*
     A            W9STAT    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('Status')
     A            W9USER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint User')
     A            W9PGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint Program')
     A            W9TIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint Time')
     A            W9DT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint Date')
     A            W9IUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial User')
     A            W9IPGM    R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Program')
     A            W9ITIM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Time')
     A            W9IDT     R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Date')
     A*** BEGIN ADD *** 09/30/03 **************************************
     A            W9TCNT    R               REFFLD(A90)
     A                                      COLHDG('Total Count')
     A            W9DCNT    R               REFFLD(A90)
     A                                      COLHDG('Duplicate Count')
     A            W9CCNT    R               REFFLD(A90)
     A                                      COLHDG('Claim Error Count')
     A            W9RCNT    R               REFFLD(A90)
     A                                      COLHDG('Recon Error Count')
     A            W9UCNT    R               REFFLD(A90)
     A                                      COLHDG('Uploaded Count')
     A*** END   ADD *** 09/30/03 **************************************
